  "goodToKnow": "Rundweg as an adverb means flatly or outright, usually with refusal: etwas rundweg ablehnen, rundweg bestreiten, rundweg verweigern. Synonyms: kategorisch, glatt (colloquial: glatt ablehnen), entschieden. As a noun, der Rundweg is a circular walking route, marked on hiking maps. Both are related to rund (round, complete)."
